{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09682","headline":"送韩巽入都觐省便赴举 · 岑参","name":"送韩巽入都觐省便赴举","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"槐叶苍苍柳叶黄，秋高八月天欲霜。\n青门百壶送韩侯，白云千里连嵩丘。\n北堂倚门望君忆，东归扇枕後秋色。\n洛阳才子能几人，明年桂枝是君得。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09682.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09682","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}